%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae0ddb8bfdb069c4ca9c82f8b9852d11, type: 3}
  m_Name: Forest - Meet Abe
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: Abe
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5ec602c4dc523c4580b750811a63e4a, type: 3}
    text: There she is. Sit, sit. You took a storm to the head, spark. Most people
      don't get up from that.
  - speaker: Wulang
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f0fce3e3ff29277478f8abc7d81c87aa, type: 3}
    text: You know me?
  - speaker: Abe
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5ec602c4dc523c4580b750811a63e4a, type: 3}
    text: Abe. I keep this old armory, and I've kept an eye on you since you were
      knee-high. ...You don't remember. That's all right. It'll come back.
  - speaker: Wulang
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f0fce3e3ff29277478f8abc7d81c87aa, type: 3}
    text: There's lightning in my hands. Is that normal?
  - speaker: Abe
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5ec602c4dc523c4580b750811a63e4a, type: 3}
    text: 'Not in the least. The Storm chose you. The elements are proud: they only
      go where they''re given. You can''t steal them, and you can''t buy them.'
  - speaker: Abe
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5ec602c4dc523c4580b750811a63e4a, type: 3}
    text: That's why the other guardians went sour. The Earth guardian has been tearing
      up the Blossom Glade for a month. Put it to rest, and its gift goes to whoever
      freed it.
  - speaker: Wulang
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f0fce3e3ff29277478f8abc7d81c87aa, type: 3}
    text: And you're sending me, because...?
  - speaker: Abe
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5ec602c4dc523c4580b750811a63e4a, type: 3}
    text: Because I'm old, and magic and I had a falling out years ago. Earth hates
      the storm. Hit it with what you've got.
  - speaker: Abe
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5ec602c4dc523c4580b750811a63e4a, type: 3}
    text: Bring me Wubucks off those vampires and I'll keep you in potions. Nothing's
      free, spark. Not even me.
  choices: []
  flagToSetWhenFinished: metAbe
